    "text": "Reno County, Kansas\nFormer Kan. school employee accused sex crimes with student\n2 hours ago\nRENO COUNTY — A former USD 309 Nickerson school district employee is in custody for alleged child sex crimes. Authorities arrested Ryan Stoecklein, 29, on Wednesday and just before 11a.m., booked him into the Reno County jail on requested charges of sexual exploitation of a child under 18 and attempted unlawful sexual relations, according to the county arrest report.",
